{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Red Rug is a piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"],". It can rotate into daily stock at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," for 1,000g or the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for between 250–2,500g."]],["p",["It's also available from the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"]," for 0g."]],["p",["One Red Rug is obtained when the ",["l","农舍","Bedroom"]," is redecorated by ",["l","潘妮","Penny"]," in her ",["l","潘妮","14-Heart"]," event, choosing Strawberry Home."]]]]]}